From: Domenico D'Arrigo <d.darrigo@outlook.it>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 19:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg/SmmStoreFvb: Format the store for
 authenticated variables

InitializeFvAndVariableStoreHeaders() formats an erased store with
gEfiVariableGuid. The variable driver takes the format of the store it
finds, so a payload built with SECURE_BOOT_ENABLE, on an erased store,
says "Variable driver will work without auth variable support!" and
Secure Boot has nowhere to keep PK, KEK, db and dbx.

Format it with gEfiAuthenticatedVariableGuid, as the variable driver
formats a store of its own (InitEmuNonVolatileVariableStore(), "for
potential auth variable support"). Without AuthVariableLib the driver
keeps working on such a store, with the header of the authenticated
format; a store already formatted is left as it is, since
ValidateFvHeader() takes both.

TEST=coreboot for QEMU q35 with SMMSTORE and this tree, the payload
built with SECURE_BOOT_ENABLE on an erased SMMSTORE: the store is
authenticated and AuthVariableLib writes CustomMode, certdb and
VendorKeysNv (ouroBIOS, tools/build.sh edk2-upstream).
---
 UefiPayloadPkg/SmmStoreFvb/SmmStoreFvbRuntimeDxe.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/UefiPayloadPkg/SmmStoreFvb/SmmStoreFvbRuntimeDxe.c b/UefiPayloadPkg/SmmStoreFvb/SmmStoreFvbRuntimeDxe.c
index 63cb760..cf29719 100644
--- a/UefiPayloadPkg/SmmStoreFvb/SmmStoreFvbRuntimeDxe.c
+++ b/UefiPayloadPkg/SmmStoreFvb/SmmStoreFvbRuntimeDxe.c
@@ -154,10 +154,11 @@ InitializeFvAndVariableStoreHeaders (
   //
   VariableStoreHeader = (VARIABLE_STORE_HEADER *)((UINTN)Headers + FirmwareVolumeHeader->HeaderLength);
   //
-  // Should be gEfiVariableGuid as SMM doesn't authenticate, but userspace does
-  // Caveat: SecureBoot requires gEfiAuthenticatedVariableGuid type of storage
+  // The authenticated format, as the variable driver formats a store of its
+  // own: it works on it also without authenticated variables, and Secure
+  // Boot needs it
   //
-  CopyGuid (&VariableStoreHeader->Signature, &gEfiVariableGuid);
+  CopyGuid (&VariableStoreHeader->Signature, &gEfiAuthenticatedVariableGuid);
   VariableStoreHeader->Size   = PcdGet32 (PcdFlashNvStorageVariableSize) - FirmwareVolumeHeader->HeaderLength;
   VariableStoreHeader->Format = VARIABLE_STORE_FORMATTED;
   VariableStoreHeader->State  = VARIABLE_STORE_HEALTHY;
